  // abil 3 (level 15): + Removal: Effects specified by Resource ×28, one per resource below:
  //   Removal: Effects specified by Resource ~ACIDOOZ3~
  //   Removal: Effects specified by Resource ~DARTMEL~
  //   Removal: Effects specified by Resource ~DEMOGORG~
